              "text": "festejar — \"to celebrate, to party\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Festejamos el cumpleaños de la abuela en el jardín. We celebrated grandma's birthday in the garden."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Very common in Latin America; celebrar is used everywhere."
            }
          ]
        },
